<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS5" title="In Appendix E Additional Analysis ‣ Approximate Domain Unlearning for Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.5 </span>Prompt Tuning vs. Parameter Tuning</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS6" title="In Appendix E Additional Analysis ‣ Approximate Domain Unlearning for Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.6 </span>Accuracy over Training Iterations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS7" title="In Appendix E Additional Analysis ‣ Approximate Domain Unlearning for Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.7 </span>Proxy Evaluation for Autonomous Driving Scenarios</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
