<figure id="A2.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span><span id="A2.T11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Robustness to Partial Domain Labels on Office-Home.</span>
Without domain estimation, the performance drops sharply as the proportion of unlabeled samples increases. In contrast, with domain estimation, the performance remains substantially higher,
